WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Sensitivity analysis. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Change one assumption and recalculate

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Sensitivity analysis changes one assumption at a time to see which inputs move the result most.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Recalculate the budget with material cost +10%; keep other inputs fixed so the effect is interpretable.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: What-if exercise

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Teaching relationships only—not live quotes, prices, tax advice or forecasts.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Change one assumption and recalculate
